⚠⚠ AND HP-5 IS VACUOUS, WHICH IS WHY THIS FILE STAYS OPEN. Added 2026-09-10 on
Tony's dispatch, which asked for the row POST-setParse. It reads 0 like HT-5, and
HP-0 says why: setParse TOOK ON THREE MEMBERS OUT OF SIXTY-FOUR. The other 61
